+ - <b>`months`</b> (array):  month of each time step (1-12), (time,) or (time, point) 
+ - <b>`latitude`</b> (array):  latitude of the points [deg], (point,). None: months unchanged 
+
+
+
+**Returns:**
+ 
+ - <b>`array`</b>:  months (1-12), (time, point) if latitude is given 
+
